Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: aurora: enable Adreno 750 with OEM ZAP firmware

The stock GPU is gen7-9-1 (chip ID 0x43051401), supported by the upstream
A750 catalog. Its ZAP reservation matches the SoC's 0x9b09a000 + 0x2000.
Keep the upstream SM8650 OPP table and voltage votes unchanged.

Reference: https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v7.3-rc5/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-qrd.dts
The firmware path is local to the Aurora OEM package.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-xiaomi-aurora.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-xiaomi-aurora.dts
@@ -15,6 +15,14 @@
 #include "pm8550vs.dtsi"
 #include "pmk8550.dtsi"
 
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&gpu_zap_shader {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8650/xiaomi/aurora/gen70900_zap.mbn";
+};
+
 / {
 	model = "Xiaomi 14 Ultra";
 	compatible = "xiaomi,aurora", "qcom,sm8650";
